    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Separate final decisions", "items": [
      "Picking an interested offer only assigns cover. Approve records leave.status=approved and decided_by/decided_at.",
      "The Approve action requires a substitute or the explicit Approve without assigning a substitute toggle.",
      "A found candidate flagged unassignable stops approval; the approver can optionally create a pending DutyAssignment.",
      "Reject saves the decision; this action does not close an existing search or cancel its offers."
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "How the timetable interprets hand-off", "items": [
      "The roster is a read-only join, not a mutation of the published lesson timetable.",
      "Only overlapping approved leaves with a substitute produce leave coverage rows. The original teacher's lessons are projected onto the substitute.",
      "Any matching pending or accepted duty yields an accepted coverage-cell label. Without matching duty, the cell is pending with No duty hand-off recorded.",
